From ed8914669d00182354f0903e095f2a1df36e7465 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Dr. Hutson" <hutsona@umsystem.edu>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:21:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(connector): RDSTLS client authentication

Add the rdstls module (capabilities, password-credentials authentication
request, authentication response with result codes such as LOGON_FAILURE
0x52E; [MS-RDPBCGR] 2.2.17) and two ClientConnector states,
RdstlsCapabilities and RdstlsAuthResponse, entered after the TLS upgrade
when the server selects PROTOCOL_RDSTLS.

Credentials come from ClientConnector::with_rdstls_credentials (built with
RdstlsCredentials::from_server_redirection) and are dropped once the request
is written. A non-success result is ConnectorErrorKind::RdstlsAuthFailed.
Existing connect_finalize drivers run the exchange unchanged through
next_pdu_hint and step.
